index":61,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":12,"end":45},{"id":"hechang-q-b7d5be9c13d282f8ce57","section":"chapter-023","block":"b-c7bd870c47f4ea5fdf93","layer":"original","quote":"子（禽）〔离〕嗣。﹝一﹞（禽）〔离〕弟（适）〔逌〕，才爽开济〖17〗。官至廷尉、吏部尚书。﹝二﹞洽同郡许混者，许劭子也〖18〗。清醇有鉴识〖19〗，明帝时为尚书。﹝三﹞","section_title":"和常杨杜赵裴传第二十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0052.xhtml","index":61,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":84},{"id":"shaodi-e-o119a-q","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-664faf315e1d49a284ae","layer":"original","quote":"五月，辛未〖7〗，帝幸辟雍。会，命群臣赋诗。侍中和逌、尚书陈骞等作诗稽留〖8〗，有司奏免官。诏曰：“吾以暗昧，爱好文雅。广延诗赋，以知得失。而乃尔纷纭〖9〗，良用反仄〖10〗。其原逌等，主者宣敕：自今以后，群臣皆当玩习古义，修明经典。称朕意焉。”","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":524,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":123},{"id":"shaodi-q-b-6209c552405e0ebbdf98","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-6209c552405e0ebbdf98","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗二年：甘露二年（公元 257 ）。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":535,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-4dd98e402a6a8de51491","start":0,"end":20},{"id":"shaodi-q-o117","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-d021e0b00f489a01f208","layer":"original","quote":"二年春二月〖1〗，青龙现温县井中。三月，司空卢毓薨。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":522,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":26},{"id":"shaodi-q-o119","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-664faf315e1d49a284ae","layer":"original","quote":"五月，辛未〖7〗，帝幸辟雍。会，命群臣赋诗。侍中和逌、尚书陈骞等作诗稽留〖8〗，有司奏免官。诏曰：“吾以暗昧，爱好文雅。广延诗赋，以知得失。而乃尔纷纭〖9〗，良用反仄〖10〗。其原逌等，主者宣敕：自今以后，群臣皆当玩习古义，修明经典。称朕意焉。”","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":524,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":123}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
